      "mds:offGasses": "None",
      "mds:procedureDetails": "A solution of (R)-8-chloro-4-methyl-2-phenyl-2,3,4,5-tetrahydropyrido[3,2-f][1,4]oxazepine (5.00 mg, 0.02 mmol) and 4-(3-methyl-1H-1,2,4-triazol-1-yl)aniline (3.17 mg, 0.02 mmol) in DME (0.5 mL) was added via a syringe to a capped microwave vial containing PALLADIUM(II) ACETATE (0.409 mg, 1.82 µmol), 2-(DICYCLOHEXYLPHOSPHINO)BIPHENYL (0.638 mg, 1.82 µmol) and KOtBu (3.06 mg, 0.03 mmol) under an argon atmosphere. The resulting mixture was heated to 100°C in a microwavwe apparatus for 1 h and analyzed by LCMS. No product.  ",
